OL,3,AUS congressman swims to safety after
OL,4,Ahis plane is forced to land on a lake
OL,5,
OL,6,FWisconsin Congressman Tom Tiffany has
OL,7,Fsaid he sustained minor injuries after
OL,8,Fa plane he was on landed on a lake,
OL,9,Fforcing him and the pilot to swim to
OL,10,Fsafety.
OL,12,FTiffany, the state's Republican nominee
OL,13,Ffor governor, was travelling in a small
OL,14,Fplane on Saturday night when the
OL,15,Faircraft encountered a mechanical
OL,16,Fissue, forcing the pilot to make an
OL,17,Femergency landing in Lake Wausau, the
OL,18,Fcounty sheriff's office said.
OL,20,FTiffany said he and the pilot called
OL,21,F911 once they landed.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
