OL,3,AUS congressman swims to safety after
OL,4,Ahis plane is forced to land on a lake
OL,5,
OL,6,F"As the plane began to submerge, we
OL,7,Fexited the aircraft and swam to a
OL,8,Fshallow area, where we waited until
OL,9,Femergency responders reached us by
OL,10,Fboat," Tiffany wrote on social media.
OL,11,FThe pilot also sustained minor
OL,12,Finjuries.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
